      "publishedAt": "2026-05-25T15:09:41.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://techcrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/GettyImages-2213411719.jpg?w=1024",
      "originalUrl": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/05/25/the-popes-ai-encyclical-isnt-really-about-ai/",
